{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Motor Racing ignites all the passion, beauty, and intensity of professional motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299970/extras/eaa9b36a815a18317cda2ccf78b03068.avif?t=1757944367\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Best, Nothing Less</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across eras in 70+ meticulously recreated cars across 10 iconic classes &amp; 27 global layouts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars: From today\u2019s radical LMDh Hypercars to history\u2019s most iconic legends, each vehicle is a licensed masterpiece</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuits: Scanned for ultimate precision and authenticity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299970/extras/56cee24464606cb17b16f8f3df732027.avif?t=1757944367\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing For All</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sim racers to first-time racers, Project Motor Racing delivers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player Career</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Racing Modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed 4-Class Race Experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/299970/extras/135bc2a023a5c76fb3fae3ee86b417d5.avif?t=1757944367\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation Refined</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p c